      "uid": "zhcn:b5c8b79112ca55f554bd3254",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯，拿下优胜这件事就交给善信我，\\n你去练习优胜者采访时的应答吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbbd6c4d4e9070cd5f67748c28020891dc7e112117e4c87c0cedf7be3d693127",
